# Vendored upstream research clones. These are independent checkouts kept for
# reference only. Fifteen carry their own .git directory and would commit as
# bare gitlinks that clone as empty directories; pathwaycom-bdh-2b0d7a45 is a
# plain tree that would be committed wholesale. All of them build their own
# Rust, Python, and Node artifacts. Keep the entire import out of this repo.
resources/github/*
# Keep the hand-authored provenance index that records what those clones are.
!resources/github/README.md
